{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"liusima-e2-wei015-071","title":"张既讨伊健妓妾、治元多，进显美设伏破胡","accounts":[{"id":"liusima-a-fb0816ac3125f8a3026f","label":"正文","text":"卢水胡伊健妓妾、治元多等反，河西大扰","evidence":["liusima-q-fa191a1adbe752162bb3"]},{"id":"liusima-a-ce06ab46d7b20a6bf426","label":"正文","text":"帝忧河西之乱，召邹岐，以张既代之","evidence":["liusima-q-5b9878e0b144a9ab2c8f"]},{"id":"liusima-a-eb58027d88c02e795e84","label":"正文","text":"帝诏张既谋略过人今则其时，以便宜从事勿复先请","evidence":["liusima-q-78bda4e0e8487c740adb"]},{"id":"liusima-a-73c4204e3f857411b567","label":"正文","text":"遣护军夏侯儒、将军费曜等继张既之后","evidence":["liusima-q-99f08230202561e54ef1"]},{"id":"liusima-a-2cc52acdac5812545073","label":"正文","text":"张既至金城力排众议渡河西进","evidence":["liusima-q-91ba5079ad5d62bbedba"]},{"id":"liusima-a-3bfe498f1c98aeaacf1c","label":"正文","text":"贼骑逆拒鹯阴口，张既扬声鹯阴潜出揟次至武威，胡引还显美","evidence":["liusima-q-295900b8d301562b62b8"]},{"id":"liusima-a-ff7d56750ebe088a52a2","label":"正文","text":"张既据武威劳赐将士，力主进军，军显美","evidence":["liusima-q-fb796c6c073763573d28"]},{"id":"liusima-a-47c4f6182e5aed76f3af","label":"正文","text":"胡骑数千因大风欲放火烧营，将士皆恐","evidence":["liusima-q-e02513496e51b61f3ac8"]},{"id":"liusima-a-56c6808baa8864094778","label":"正文","text":"张既夜设伏兵，使成公英挑战佯退，大破胡，斩首获生以万数","evidence":["liusima-q-037b7315ddb88169745e"]},{"id":"liusima-a-68feef8b5164ebebd4b8","label":"正文","text":"帝诏褒张既破胡之功，徙封西乡侯增邑二百","evidence":["liusima-q-2aa5898655c68d54735f"]}],"participants":[{"person":"liusima-p0002","role":"卢水胡，与治元多等反，河西大扰","evidence":["liusima-q-fa191a1adbe752162bb3"]},{"person":"wudi-p0170","role":"忧之，称非既莫能安凉州，乃召邹岐，以既代之；诏既引贾复请击郾贼故事，称卿谋略过人今则其时，以便宜从事，勿复先请；遣护军夏侯儒、将军费曜等继既后；甚悦，诏褒既逾河历险、以劳击逸、以寡胜众，功过南仲勤逾吉甫，此勋永宁河右，徙封西乡侯","evidence":["liusima-q-5b9878e0b144a9ab2c8f","liusima-q-78bda4e0e8487c740adb","liusima-q-99f08230202561e54ef1","liusima-q-2aa5898655c68d54735f"]},{"person":"wgc-p0068","role":"代邹岐统军，显美设伏破胡","evidence":["liusima-q-5b9878e0b144a9ab2c8f","liusima-q-78bda4e0e8487c740adb","liusima-q-91ba5079ad5d62bbedba","liusima-q-295900b8d301562b62b8","liusima-q-fb796c6c073763573d28","liusima-q-e02513496e51b61f3ac8","liusima-q-037b7315ddb88169745e","liusima-q-2aa5898655c68d54735f"]},{"person":"liusima-p0062","role":"被召还","evidence":["liusima-q-5b9878e0b144a9ab2c8f"]},{"person":"xiahoucao-p0025","role":"护军，受遣继既后；等犹未达","evidence":["liusima-q-99f08230202561e54ef1","liusima-q-fb796c6c073763573d28"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0012","role":"将军，受遣继既后；继至武威","evidence":["liusima-q-99f08230202561e54ef1","liusima-q-fb796c6c073763573d28"]},{"person":"liusima-p0032","role":"参军，督千余骑挑战佯退","evidence":["liusima-q-037b7315ddb88169745e"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本篇独立行动，未继承范围不同的旧事件日期。","evidence":["liusima-q-fa191a1adbe752162bb3","liusima-q-5b9878e0b144a9ab2c8f","liusima-q-78bda4e0e8487c740adb","liusima-q-99f08230202561e54ef1","liusima-q-91ba5079ad5d62bbedba","liusima-q-295900b8d301562b62b8","liusima-q-fb796c6c073763573d28","liusima-q-e02513496e51b61f3ac8","liusima-q-037b7315ddb88169745e","liusima-q-2aa5898655c68d54735f"]},"ordering_evidence":"liusima-q-fa191a1adbe752162bb3","related_events":[{"event":"wendi-e-p080a","type":"related","evidence":["liusima-q-fa191a1adbe752162bb3","liusima-q-5b9878e0b144a9ab2c8f","liusima-q-78bda4e0e8487c740adb","liusima-q-99f08230202561e54ef1","liusima-q-91ba5079ad5d62bbedba","liusima-q-295900b8d301562b62b8","liusima-q-fb796c6c073763573d28","liusima-q-e02513496e51b61f3ac8","liusima-q-037b7315ddb88169745e","liusima-q-2aa5898655c68d54735f","wendi-e-p080a-q"]}],"order":3304}],"persons":[{"id":"liusima-p0002","name":"伊健妓妾","evidence":["liusima-q-fa191a1adbe752162bb3"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"liusima-q-037b7315ddb88169745e","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-47e6be1e6d480e0b839e","layer":"original","quote":"既夜藏精卒三千人为伏，使参军成公英，督千余骑挑战，敕使佯退。胡果争奔之，因发伏，截其后；首尾进击，大破之，斩首获生以万数","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":163,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":143,"end":203},{"id":"liusima-q-295900b8d301562b62b8","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-8118e588c621947e4c3d","layer":"original","quote":"贼七千余骑。逆拒军于鹯阴口〖6〗。既扬声军由鹯阴〖7〗，乃潜由（且）〔揟〕次出至武威〖8〗。胡以为神，引还显美","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":162,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":72,"end":127},{"id":"liusima-q-2aa5898655c68d54735f","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-09fc0acef808d7824108","layer":"original","quote":"帝甚悦，诏曰：“卿逾河历险，以劳击逸，以寡胜众；功过南仲〖10〗，勤逾吉甫〖11〗。此勋非但破胡，乃永宁河右：使吾长无西顾之念矣！”徙封西乡侯，增邑二百；并前四百户","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":164,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":82},{"id":"liusima-q-5b9878e0b144a9ab2c8f","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-317ca5b514e793107c31","layer":"original","quote":"帝忧之，曰：“非既莫能安凉州。”乃召邹岐，以既代之","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":24,"end":49},{"id":"liusima-q-78bda4e0e8487c740adb","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-317ca5b514e793107c31","layer":"original","quote":"诏曰：“昔贾复请击郾贼〖3〗，光武笑曰：‘执金吾击郾，吾复何忧？’卿谋略过人，今则其时。以便宜从事，勿复先请","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":50,"end":104},{"id":"liusima-q-91ba5079ad5d62bbedba","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-8118e588c621947e4c3d","layer":"original","quote":"既至金城，欲渡河，诸将、守以为：“兵少道险，未可深入。”既曰：“道虽险，非井陉之隘；夷狄乌合，无左车之计〖5〗。今武威危急，赴之宜速！”遂渡河","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":162,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":71},{"id":"liusima-q-99f08230202561e54ef1","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-317ca5b514e793107c31","layer":"original","quote":"遣护军夏侯儒、将军费曜等，继其后","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":109,"end":125},{"id":"liusima-q-e02513496e51b61f3ac8","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-47e6be1e6d480e0b839e","layer":"original","quote":"胡骑数千，因大风欲放火烧营，将士皆恐","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":163,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":124,"end":142},{"id":"liusima-q-fa191a1adbe752162bb3","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-317ca5b514e793107c31","layer":"original","quote":"凉州卢水胡伊健妓妾、治元多等反〖2〗，河西大扰","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":23},{"id":"liusima-q-fb796c6c073763573d28","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-47e6be1e6d480e0b839e","layer":"original","quote":"既已据武威，曜乃至，儒等犹未达。既劳赐将士，欲进军击胡。诸将皆曰：“士卒疲倦，虏众气锐，难与争锋。”既曰：“今军无现粮，当因敌为资。若虏见兵合，退依深山；追之则道险穷饿，兵还则出候寇抄。如此，兵不得解，所谓‘一日纵敌，患在数世’也。”遂前，军显美","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":163,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":123},{"id":"wendi-e-p080a-q","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-f526d1a1f2ac1dd03e36","layer":"pei","quote":"十一月辛未，镇西将军曹真命众将及州郡兵，讨破叛胡治元多、卢水封赏等。斩首五万余级，获生口十万，羊一百一十一万口，牛八万，河西遂平。","attribution":"裴注·魏书","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":280,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-dea0b21111fc3c1b95dd","start":10,"end":75}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
